      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwavela abaprofethi bamanga phakathi kwabantu, njengokuba lakini kuzakuba khona abafundisi bamanga abazakungenisa ngensitha izifundiso ezichithayo, bephika iNkosi eyabathengayo, bezilethela ngokuphangisa ukuchitheka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanengi bazakulandela amanyala abo; langenxa yabo indlela yeqiniso izakuthukwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekufiseni kwabo imali bazakuthengiselana ngani ngamazwi obuqili; ukulahlwa kwabo sekukade kusebenza phakathi kwabo, lokuchitheka kwabo kakuwozeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu kaziyekelanga izithunywa ezonayo, kodwa waziphosela esihogweni ezinikela emigodini yomnyama, ukuba zigcinwe kuze kube lusuku lokulahlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaliyekelanga ilizwe lasendulo mhla eletha uzamcolo emhlabeni oweyisa uNkulunkulu, kodwa walondoloza uNowa owayengumtshumayeli wokulunga kanye labanye abayisikhombisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Gen 6:1—7:24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lemizi yaseSodoma laseGomora wayichitha ngokuyitshisa ngomlilo, eyenza ibe yisibonelo kulabo abeyisa uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa wamophula uLoti olungileyo, owahlutshwa yikuhamba okubi kwabangalunganga;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.1+GEN.19.2+GEN.19.3+GEN.19.4+GEN.19.5+GEN.19.6+GEN.19.7+GEN.19.8+GEN.19.9+GEN.19.10+GEN.19.11+GEN.19.12+GEN.19.13+GEN.19.14+GEN.19.15+GEN.19.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 19:1–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngoba lowomuntu olungileyo, ngokuhlala kwakhe phakathi kwabo, wezwa ubuhlungu emphefumulweni wakhe ngokubona lokuzwa insuku zonke izinto ezimbi ezenziwayo yibo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke iNkosi iyakwazi ukubophula ekulingweni labo abamkhonzayo uNkulunkulu, lokubagcina ababi ekutshayweni kuze kube lusuku lokuthonisiswa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikakhulu bona abazithokozisa ngenkanuko ezingcolisayo, bedelela amandla eNkosi. Abalenkani abaziqakisayo kabesabi ukuhlambaza labo abalenkazimulo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanti izithunywa, lanxa zizinkulu ngamandla azo, kazibamangaleli ngenhlamba phambi kukaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lababantu bahlambaza izinto abangazaziyo, banjengezinyamazana ezingelangqondo, ezazalelwa ukubanjwa lokubulawa, labo bazakubhujiswa ekubhujisweni kwazo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamukele umvuzo ngokungalungi kwabo. Bathi kuyikuthokoza ukuminza emini, bengcolile, bebabi, beminza ekuthokozeni kwabo, bezitika lani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balamehlo akhangele ubufebe langayekeli ukukhangela isono; bayenga ababuthakathaka; balenhliziyo ezejwayele ubuhwaba; bangabantwana abaqalekisiweyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "batshiye indlela eqondileyo, baduha, balandela indlela kaBalami, indodana kaBeyori, owayethanda inzuzo yokwenza okubi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6+NUM.22.7+NUM.22.8+NUM.22.9+NUM.22.10+NUM.22.11+NUM.22.12+NUM.22.13+NUM.22.14+NUM.22.15+NUM.22.16+NUM.22.17+NUM.22.18+NUM.22.19+NUM.22.20+NUM.22.21+NUM.22.22+NUM.22.23+NUM.22.24+NUM.22.25+NUM.22.26+NUM.22.27+NUM.22.28+NUM.22.29+NUM.22.30+NUM.22.31+NUM.22.32+NUM.22.33+NUM.22.34+NUM.22.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 22:4–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa wasolwa ngenxa yeziphambeko zakhe; ubabhemi oyisimungulu wakhuluma ngelizwi lomuntu, wanqanda ubuhlanya bomprofethi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laba bayimithombo engelamanzi, lenkungu eqhutshwa yisiphepho, abagcinelwe umnyama omkhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuziqakisa okuyize bayabayenga ngezinkanuko zomzimba langamanyala labo asebephose baphuma ekuduheni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bebathembisa inkululeko, kanti bona uqobo bayizigqili zokubola; ngoba lokho umuntu ahlulwa yikho uyisigqili sakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba emva kokuba sebephephile ekungcoleni komhlaba ngokuyazi iNkosi yethu loMsilisi uJesu Kristu, babuye behilelwa, bahlulwa yikho, ukucina kwabo kubi kulokuqala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngabe kwaba ngcono kibo uba babengayazanga indlela yokulunga kulokuba kuthi sebeyazile bafulathele umlayo ongcwele ababewunikiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubehlele ngokwesaga esiqinisileyo esithi: Inja ibuyela emahlanzweni ayo; lokuthi: Ingulube igeziswa ibuye iphindele ekuzibhixeni ngodaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
